						SPIC — Recommended Credit Limit
					</h4>
					<p class="credit-desc mb-3">Score: @SpicTotalMark.ToString("N0")/100. @* (Grade @GetGradeFromScore(SpicScorePercent)) *@ @* → Max @SpicCreditPercent% of previous year sales turnover with SPIC (₹ @SpicSalesTurnover.ToString("N2") Lakhs) *@.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="col-md-12">
					<div class="row g-3">
						<div class="col-md-4">
							<div class="credit-box">
								<div class="credit-box-label">Proposed Limit</div>
								<div class="credit-box-val">₹ @SpicProposedLimit.ToString("N2")</div>
							</div>
